menu "NomadCast"

    config NOMADCAST_USB_MSC
        bool "USB Mass Storage (SD card as USB disk)"
        default n
        help
            Expose the SD card to a PC as a USB mass-storage device
            (plug USB cable → SD card appears as a removable disk).

            DISABLED for now: the board has no USB VBUS detection circuit,
            so USB hot-plug cannot be detected reliably. Also, the USB-OTG
            (TinyUSB) stack disables USB-Serial-JTAG flashing/monitor, so
            keep this OFF for development builds.

endmenu
